      en: ["Hoani is an official center for the protection of green sea turtles.", "The town is located about 10 kilometers east of the island's capital, Fomboni.", "The nearby marine park was officially established in 2001.", "Hoani features several community-run eco-bungalows for tourists.", "The waters off Hoani are known for their populations of sea cows (dugongs).", "The local population practices sustainable fishing using traditional methods."],
