      en: ["Southernmost point of Grande Comore island", "Main hub for transportation to Mohéli", "Known for Kwassa-Kwassa boat taxis", "White sandy beaches with volcanic rock formations", "Center for traditional boat repair", "Famous for fresh-caught seafood"],
